SUMMARY:Deadline: Glasgow Short Film Festival 2027 (20th edition)
DESCRIPTION:Scotland's leading short film festival marks its 20th edition i
 n March 2027. International entries compete for the Bill Douglas Award for
  International Short Film\; films must be completed after 30 September 202
 5 and run 40 minutes or less. Deadlines: earlybird 4 August 2026 (GBP 10)\
 , regular 22 September 2026 (GBP 14)\, late 27 October 2026 (GBP 18).\n\nO
 rganisation: Glasgow Short Film Festival\nLocation: Glasgow\, Scotland\, U
 nited Kingdom (festival 17-21 March 2027). Open to international entries.\
 nAward: Selection for GSFF including the Bill Douglas Award for Internatio
 nal Short Film. Entry fees: GBP 10 earlybird\, GBP 14 regular\, GBP 18 lat
 e (slightly higher via FilmFreeway).\nDuration: Festival 17-21 March 2027.
  Films completed after 30 September 2025\, max 40 minutes.\n\nMore: https:
 //glasgowshort.org/submissions/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_
 medium=referral
URL:https://glasgowshort.org/submissions/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrant
 desk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Glasgow\, Scotland\, United Kingdom (festival 17-21 March 2027). O
 pen to international entries.
END:VEVENT
