 dwide in all formats. Deadlines: 6 December 2026 (USD 80)\, 6 February 202
 7 (USD 85)\, final 6 April 2027 (USD 95).\n\nOrganisation: New Media Film 
 Festival\nLocation: Los Angeles\, California\, United States (2 June 2027 
 online\, 3 June 2027 in LA). Open worldwide\, all formats.\nAward: Screeni
 ng and awards\; grand prize includes industry meetings (HBO\, Marvel)\, LA
  studio time\, production services\, and USD 1\,000 in tools. Entry fees: 
 USD 80 (by 6 December 2026)\, USD 85 (by 6 February 2027)\, USD 95 final.\
 nDuration: Festival 2-3 June 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.newmediafilmfestiv
 al.com/submit/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
