 es eligible for consideration for the Academy Award for Best Documentary F
 eature)\, EUR 5\,000 Grand Jury Fiction award\, and EUR 1\,500 Shorts awar
 d\; further competitions (Activist Lens\, Justice Frame\, Dutch Focus\, Ed
 ucation Award\, Audience Award) publish no amounts. SUBMISSION FEE: EUR 25
  until 30 September 2026\, EUR 35 late fee 1 October to 1 November 2026\; 
 fee waivers only in very exceptional cases.\n\nMore: https://moviesthatmat
 ter.nl/en/festival/industry/film-submissions/?utm_source=artificialnouveau
