 th Korea's longest river.\n\nOrganisation: Busan Metropolitan City\, Urban
  Parks Division\nLocation: Eulsukdo\, Busan\, South Korea (site at 1142-8 
 Hadan-dong\, Saha-gu). Open to individuals and teams worldwide\; the commi
 ssioned work is realised on site.\nAward: One proposal selected. Artwork s
 upport KRW 380\,000\,000 (approx. EUR 235\,000) plus artist fee KRW 20\,00
 0\,000 (approx. EUR 12\,500). No entry fee indicated.\nDuration: Single co
 mmission\; provisional opening May to June 2027.\n\nMore: https://eulsukdo
 -ecoart.com/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
