DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261122
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
SUMMARY:Deadline: Fondation Francois Schneider: Talents Contemporains 16th 
 Edition - Water
DESCRIPTION:The Fondation Francois Schneider's Talents Contemporains compet
 ition\, in its 16th edition\, supports contemporary creation on the theme 
 of WATER. Submissions can be a project for an installation or sculpture\, 
 or an existing unique work in painting\, drawing\, sculpture\, installatio
 n\, photography\, video\, textile art or other fine and visual arts\; perf
 orming arts and music are excluded.\n\nOrganisation: Fondation Francois Sc
 hneider\nLocation: Wattwiller\, France. Open internationally to visual art
 ists of all nationalities (legal age).\nAward: EUR 15\,000 per laureate (m
 erit prize plus acquisition of the work\; EUR 8\,000 when the work is part
  of a multiple edition\, e.g. photo or video)\; up to 7 laureates. Sculptu
 re and installation projects can additionally receive up to EUR 50\,000 in
  production assistance. No entry fee stated.\nDuration: Call open 23 Septe
 mber to 22 November 2026. Laureates get an exhibition at the foundation's 
